---
// TrustCertifications.astro - 金属包装/易开盖海外合规与认证板块
---

<section class="py-20 bg-white border-t border-gray-100">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- 头部标题 -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <span class="text-blue-600 font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider">Trust & Certifications</span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-2">Export-Ready Compliance for Western Markets</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 mt-4 text-base">
        Our metal packaging and easy-open ends meet the stringent food-contact and quality standards demanded by EU and North American importers, distributors, and global food brands.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 6 大证书网格 (3列 x 2行) -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      
      <!-- 1. FDA 21 CFR -->
      <div class="bg-gray-50/60 border border-gray-200/80 p-8 rounded-2xl hover:border-blue-500/50 transition-colors flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-600/10 text-blue-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-base mb-6">
            FDA
          </div>
          <div class="text-xs text-blue-600 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">North America Pass</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">FDA 21 CFR Compliance</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Meets FDA 21 CFR 175.300 / 177 standards for inner coatings, solvent resistance, and total extractives in food-contact metal surfaces.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-gray-200/60 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-gray-500 font-medium">
          <span>Mandatory for US Market</span>
          <span class="text-blue-600 font-semibold">Verified Test Report</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 2. EU 1935/2004 & LFGB -->
      <div class="bg-gray-50/60 border border-gray-200/80 p-8 rounded-2xl hover:border-blue-500/50 transition-colors flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-600/10 text-blue-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-base mb-6">
            EU
          </div>
          <div class="text-xs text-blue-600 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">European Passport</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">EU 1935/2004 & LFGB</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Strict heavy metal migration and sensory testing compliant with German LFGB and EU framework regulations, complete with DoC.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-gray-200/60 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-gray-500 font-medium">
          <span>Strict EU Standard</span>
          <span class="text-blue-600 font-semibold">DoC Available</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 3. BRCGS Packaging Materials (高亮加粗边框) -->
      <div class="bg-gradient-to-b from-blue-50/40 to-gray-50/60 border-2 border-blue-500/40 p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm transition-colors flex flex-col justify-between relative">
        <div class="absolute top-4 right-4">
          <span class="bg-blue-600 text-white text-xs font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider">Top Tier</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-base mb-6 shadow-sm">
            BRC
          </div>
          <div class="text-xs text-blue-600 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">GFSI Recognized</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">BRCGS Packaging</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Global standard for packaging safety. The premier choice for multinational food brands, supermarket chains, and high-trust audits.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-blue-100 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-gray-500 font-medium">
          <span>Factory Hard Power</span>
          <span class="text-blue-600 font-semibold">Audited Facility</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 4. FSSC 22000 / ISO 22000 -->
      <div class="bg-gray-50/60 border border-gray-200/80 p-8 rounded-2xl hover:border-blue-500/50 transition-colors flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-600/10 text-blue-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-base mb-6">
            FSSC
          </div>
          <div class="text-xs text-blue-600 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Food Safety System</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">FSSC / ISO 22000</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            HACCP-based hygiene and hazard control ensuring clean, food-grade manufacturing environments for canning supply chains.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-gray-200/60 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-gray-500 font-medium">
          <span>GMP Clean Production</span>
          <span class="text-blue-600 font-semibold">Certified</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 5. BPA-Free / BPA-NI -->
      <div class="bg-gray-50/60 border border-gray-200/80 p-8 rounded-2xl hover:border-blue-500/50 transition-colors flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-600/10 text-blue-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs mb-6">
            BPA-NI
          </div>
          <div class="text-xs text-blue-600 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Eco & Safety</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">BPA-NI Compliance</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Non-Intentional Bisphenol-A formulation for inner coatings, meeting strict California Prop 65 and European baby-food regulations.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-gray-200/60 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-gray-500 font-medium">
          <span>Coating Security</span>
          <span class="text-blue-600 font-semibold">Test Report Ready</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 6. ISO 9001 -->
      <div class="bg-gray-50/60 border border-gray-200/80 p-8 rounded-2xl hover:border-blue-500/50 transition-colors flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-600/10 text-blue-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm mb-6">
            ISO9001
          </div>
          <div class="text-xs text-blue-600 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Quality Foundation</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">ISO 9001:2015</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Core international quality management foundation ensuring consistent batch production, process control, and traceability.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-gray-200/60 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-gray-500 font-medium">
          <span>Baseline Standard</span>
          <span class="text-blue-600 font-semibold">ISO Certified</span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- 底部合规声明提示 -->
    <div class="mt-12 text-center">
      <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">
        Certificate copies, migration test reports, and declarations of compliance (DoC) are available upon request for buyer due diligence and audits.
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>